    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>许多年后回头看，巴黎奥运会就会是巴黎“美好感”的顶点。法国摇摇欲坠，不过这艘船上还是有美好的人在拉美好的琴。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 巴黎奥运会后一地鸡毛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 物价上涨的简单例子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 没钱没创造，只有祖宗的遗产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> “无论如何，法国人创造美的能力是在线的”——我已经改变了我的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 欧洲其他地方状况更糟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 我继续待在摇摇欲坠的法国么</span></p>]]></description>
